    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892790/extras/ba1a29b80c70501511a5ce2e90b42837.poster.avif?t=1726661394\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892790/extras/ba1a29b80c70501511a5ce2e90b42837.webm?t=1726661394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892790/extras/ba1a29b80c70501511a5ce2e90b42837.mp4?t=1726661394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Polimines is a challenging logic game that brings together mechanics from Nonograms and Minesweeper. Solve increasingly difficult hand-designed levels in this puzzle game where guessing is never required.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892790/extras/074891a9736941eabf2fea4b1fedce87.poster.avif?t=1726661394\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892790/extras/074891a9736941eabf2fea4b1fedce87.webm?t=1726661394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892790/extras/074891a9736941eabf2fea4b1fedce87.mp4?t=1726661394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Combine Nonogram and Minesweeper gameplay for a unique puzzle experience.<br><br>Different level shapes allow new mechanics to emerge.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 30 increasingly difficult levels<br></li><li> Relaxing Atmosphere<br></li><li> No Guessing Required</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892790/extras/ba1a29b80c70501511a5ce2e90b42837.poster.avif?t=1726661394\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892790/extras/ba1a29b80c70501511a5ce2e90b42837.webm?t=1726661394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892790/extras/ba1a29b80c70501511a5ce2e90b42837.mp4?t=1726661394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Polimines is a challenging logic game that brings together mechanics from Nonograms and Minesweeper. Solve increasingly difficult hand-designed levels in this puzzle game where guessing is never required.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892790/extras/074891a9736941eabf2fea4b1fedce87.poster.avif?t=1726661394\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892790/extras/074891a9736941eabf2fea4b1fedce87.webm?t=1726661394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892790/extras/074891a9736941eabf2fea4b1fedce87.mp4?t=1726661394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Combine Nonogram and Minesweeper gameplay for a unique puzzle experience.<br><br>Different level shapes allow new mechanics to emerge.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 30 increasingly difficult levels<br></li><li> Relaxing Atmosphere<br></li><li> No Guessing Required</li></ul>",
